    "updated_at": "2022-05-25T06:51:40Z",
    "body": "As @davidkna pointed out on Discord, this smells like https://github.com/rust-lang/git2-rs/issues/838.\r\n\r\nThe only solution offered on that issue is to upgrade the version of cargo to 1.60 or greater. It looks like they won't be fixing it on their end. \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, browsing through the CI logs didn't give me any insight into what version of cargo their runner is using, so I can't be 100% certain that it's the same bug, but it seems highly likely.",
